WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.870
On the Suffolk coast, a developer
proposed a new nuclear power station:

2
00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:09.830
two reactors, about
3,340 megawatts in total.

3
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:15.290
Right next door is RSPB Minsmere, part
of a Special Protection Area and Ramsar

4
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:16.230
site.

5
00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:20.790
The application drew
1,282 formal comments,

6
00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:23.230
known as relevant representations.

7
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:24.330
Who sent them?

8
00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.350
And when the decision
came, whose side won?

9
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:31.610
In this mission, you'll map the
pressures on a crowded coast:

10
00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:34.930
energy, tourism, housing and conservation.

11
00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:37.970
Then you'll examine the
plant's planned sea defence:

12
00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:41.730
a hard defence reaching
12.6 metres above datum,

13
00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:44.250
fronted by a sacrificial dune.

14
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:47.910
Your mission: find out who
commented on the Sizewell C plan,

15
00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:49.710
and decide who won.
